/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
/*  University logo system                                             */
/*  Logos are pulled live from the Google favicon CDN using each        */
/*  university's official domain. If the request fails (bad domain,     */
/*  offline, blocked), onError hides the <img> and reveals a coloured   */
/*  monogram badge instead, so a logo slot is never empty.              */
